        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5F6368" value="四条必要条件缺一条，就只能停在 Curated Guidance——绝不写一条「看起来在管、其实没查」的规则" vertex="1">
